WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.447 --> 00:00:05.114
(gentle instrumental music)

00:00:07.917 --> 00:00:10.283
- [Voiceover] Sudan,

00:00:10.283 --> 00:00:11.116
Najin,

00:00:12.709 --> 00:00:13.542
Fatu.

00:00:14.768 --> 00:00:17.363
These are the last three
northern white rhinos

00:00:17.363 --> 00:00:19.673
left in the world.

00:00:19.673 --> 00:00:23.667
They're here at Ol Pejeta
Conservancy in Kenya.

00:00:23.667 --> 00:00:25.601
Efforts by the staff and veterinarians

00:00:25.601 --> 00:00:27.619
are their last chance to keep these rhinos

00:00:27.619 --> 00:00:30.119
from going extinct completely.

00:00:32.826 --> 00:00:35.436
- My name is Doctor Stephen Ngulu.

00:00:35.436 --> 00:00:37.205
I work at Ol Pejeta Conservancy

00:00:37.205 --> 00:00:39.622
as the wildlife veterinarian.

00:00:40.518 --> 00:00:42.798
Poachers have been the main cause

00:00:42.798 --> 00:00:45.950
of the loss of this subspecies.

00:00:45.980 --> 00:00:49.967
There's huge demand for rhino
horn and rhino products.

00:00:49.967 --> 00:00:52.486
If there wasn't a demand
for it, for rhino horn,

00:00:52.486 --> 00:00:53.976
there wouldn't be poaching.

00:00:53.976 --> 00:00:55.539
It's like the war against terrorism.

00:00:55.539 --> 00:00:58.956
It is a very dangerous kind of situation.

00:01:01.337 --> 00:01:02.170
- [Voiceover] The northern white rhinos

00:01:02.170 --> 00:01:04.418
were brought to the conservancy in 2009,

00:01:04.418 --> 00:01:06.935
from a zoo in the Czech Republic.

00:01:06.935 --> 00:01:08.565
Even though they live on the conservancy,

00:01:08.565 --> 00:01:10.749
they're still at risk from poachers.

00:01:10.749 --> 00:01:14.916
To keep the rhinos safe, they're
watched around the clock.

00:01:40.891 --> 00:01:42.244
- [Voiceover] The keepers are keenly aware

00:01:42.244 --> 00:01:43.819
that the rhinos have been brought here

00:01:43.819 --> 00:01:46.277
to live out their last days.

00:01:46.277 --> 00:01:49.531
So far, breeding efforts
have been unsuccessful

00:01:49.531 --> 00:01:52.118
and though the chances
are slim, around 30%,

00:01:52.118 --> 00:01:56.285
the last hope they have is to
try in-vitro fertilization.

00:02:08.508 --> 00:02:12.175
(gentle instrumental music)

